  "input": "Which team was wrongly recorded as the owner of the notifier before the record was corrected?\n[2025-06-27] handover/2025-06-27-notifier-correction: Correction to the handover note of 2025-06-11: the notification service went to the Dune team, not team Cinder. The Cinder team never owned it; the note was written against the wrong team. [2025-07-03] handover/2025-07-03-billing-api-correction: Fixing an error in the 2025-06-09 handover: the new owner of billing-api is Atlas. Team Boreal was recorded by mistake and never held it. [2025-01-09] standup/boreal/2025-01-09-2: The Boreal team owns the notifier.",
